Spain registry-first diagnostic corpus

Obra derivada de CartoCiudad, captura 2026-10-19, CC-BY 4.0 scne.es (IGN/CNIG).

CartoCiudad, Instituto Geográfico Nacional / Centro Nacional de Información
Geográfica (IGN/CNIG), through the official IDEE OGC API Features address
collection. Harmonized address facts originate from the authorities identified
by dataProvider in each case's source provenance.
https://api-features.idee.es/collections/address
https://www.cartociudad.es/

Reuse is under CC BY 4.0 / IGN geographic-information reuse conditions:
https://www.ign.es/resources/licencia/Condiciones_licenciaUso_IGN.pdf
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This corpus is a sampled, reformatted adaptation with derived query variants;
IGN/CNIG and the originating authorities have not endorsed it. Postal-code
fields are excluded because their redistribution rights were not established.
No geocoder responses supply expectations. No surveyed-entrance precision is
claimed. Shared source ancestry with index data limits independence.
See docs/registry/es.md for source capture, sampling and eligibility limitations.
